<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB DETAILS H1 REVENUE BY REGION.</title>
<headline>ABB DETAILS H1 REVENUE BY REGION.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997:</p>
<p>				     (million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>					   Pct/Total		Pct/Total</p>
<p> Group revenues	    15,198     100     vs 15,608    100</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p> Europe			8,398	55	vs 8,804     56</p>
<p> The Americas		3,019	20	vs 2,929     19</p>
<p> Asia/Australasia	  2,699	18	vs 2,859     18</p>
<p> Middle East, Africa     1,082	 7	vs 1,016     7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG.</p>
<p>Figures are for third-party revenues in each region, excluding exports which are accounted for in the revenue figures of the importing region.</p>
<p>-- Peter Nielsen, Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
